                                                "sense_id": "a7f32ae1-08f3-3df7-86b6-ddf6cc160106",
                                                "text": "However, Dr Rommer believed that despite the NDEs being distressing, it still had positive, life-changing effects such as the NDEr becoming less judgemental and feeling an increased love of life and heightened sense of morality."
